      "content": "Okay, I just checked the logs on my end—the telematics show they were doing 90mph in a 55mph zone. That basically voids their coverage, right? If we pay this out now, we're essentially throwing money away on a claim that should be denied. Are you sure about recommending a settlement given that speed data?",
